     "<div><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dear all,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">We are\r\ndelighted to announce that we are launching an online </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/\" title=\"GGIR training service\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490104551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bqAuB_jSVCTSmI99QKrtX\">GGIR training service</a></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">We offer two\r\ntraining options: A </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">standard training </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">(3 x 3 hours) in which we will\r\nfocus on common use-cases of GGIR, and a </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">private training </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">(3 x 2 hours)\r\nfor small (4 participants max) and large groups (15 participants max) in which\r\nwe will be able to discuss the specific GGIR analysis plan for your dataset. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">The next\r\nstandard training will be held on November 14-16 (at a time friendly to the\r\neastern half of the globe) and November 28-30 November (at a time friendly to\r\nthe western half of the globe). There are 25 seats available for each of them.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">For\r\na detailed description and options to book your seat go to our dedicated\r\nwebpage: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490104551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bqAuB_jSVCTSmI99QKrtX\">https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/</a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem\">Do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions via <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">trai...@accelting.com</a>.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">Kind\r\nregards,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\">Vincent and\r\nJairo</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Arial;line-height:normal\"> </span><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"font-family:Arial\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490104552000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aZctrCC0lgrH8MAp5gmJ6\">https://accelting.com/</a></p></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:14px\"><div><div><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/757505cbb4b75/image?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n            <div>\r\n        \r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
